{"3669270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forpost", "steam_appid": 3669270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortpost</strong> – A tactical shooter with base defense in a 5x5 km open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Present day. A former military specialist, after years of dangerous service, decides to return home and find a quiet place to rest and figure out what to do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guarding a remote, soon-to-be-decommissioned military base in the desert seemed like the perfect job for that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, as always, something went wrong: first, unsettling questions arose about the place, and then events rapidly unfolded—the kind you’d only expect to see in sci-fi movies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras/843a36f4b2dea250dbfbe781c0e326fb.avif?t=1761339813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras_big/843a36f4b2dea250dbfbe781c0e326fb.avif?t=1761339813 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hunt down enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stop them from breaking through your territory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore facilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Search for weapons and ammo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Upgrade your vehicle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Monitor damage and fuel indicators</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Figure out what’s really going on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• And most importantly—buy time until the army arrives<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras/b6289700cda0d8594cf46bc491074422.avif?t=1761339813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras_big/b6289700cda0d8594cf46bc491074422.avif?t=1761339813 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No traditional base – The entire map serves as a buffer zone to defend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on mobility – Dynamic movement over static defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical layer – Slow enemy advances and control their routes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource-driven progression – Loot is essential to continue, repair, and upgrade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle as a mobile base – Weapons, fast travel, and storage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global consequences – Enemy breakthroughs impact the story and game world</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortpost</strong> – A tactical shooter with base defense in a 5x5 km open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Present day. A former military specialist, after years of dangerous service, decides to return home and find a quiet place to rest and figure out what to do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guarding a remote, soon-to-be-decommissioned military base in the desert seemed like the perfect job for that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, as always, something went wrong: first, unsettling questions arose about the place, and then events rapidly unfolded—the kind you’d only expect to see in sci-fi movies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras/843a36f4b2dea250dbfbe781c0e326fb.avif?t=1761339813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras_big/843a36f4b2dea250dbfbe781c0e326fb.avif?t=1761339813 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hunt down enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stop them from breaking through your territory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore facilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Search for weapons and ammo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Upgrade your vehicle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Monitor damage and fuel indicators</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Figure out what’s really going on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• And most importantly—buy time until the army arrives<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras/b6289700cda0d8594cf46bc491074422.avif?t=1761339813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras_big/b6289700cda0d8594cf46bc491074422.avif?t=1761339813 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No traditional base – The entire map serves as a buffer zone to defend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on mobility – Dynamic movement over static defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical layer – Slow enemy advances and control their routes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource-driven progression – Loot is essential to continue, repair, and upgrade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle as a mobile base – Weapons, fast travel, and storage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global consequences – Enemy breakthroughs impact the story and game world</p>", "short_description": "You are alone in this invasion sector, as everyone else is busy repelling the ongoing attack in other areas. There is only one objective — prevent the enemy from breaking through until the main forces arrive.", "supported_languages": "Russian<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/5c385620b5a14f6ff2dc4d780b6f5afb4779d8cb/header.jpg?t=1761339813", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/7cc5cb670da3a321ad2156f30440ed749c65fd90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761339813", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/7cc5cb670da3a321ad2156f30440ed749c65fd90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761339813", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 10400, AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 (6G VRAM), AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT (6G VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 85 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i7 12700k, AMD Ryzen 7 7800x3D<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3070 (8G VRAM), AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT (16GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 85 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["NIKULIN GAME STUDIO"], "publishers": ["NIKULIN GAME STUDIO"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/c762a24e1edfca86613bbf63771430342bcb6cfa/ss_c762a24e1edfca86613bbf63771430342bcb6cfa.600x338.jpg?t=1761339813", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/c762a24e1edfca86613